{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17928","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 一 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗前两好树，衆叶光薿薿。\n秋风一拂披，策策鸣不已。\n微灯照空牀，夜半偏入耳。\n愁忧无端来，感叹成坐起。\n天明视颜色，与故不相似。\n羲和驱日月，疾急不可恃。\n浮生虽多涂，趋死惟一轨。\n胡爲浪自苦，得酒且欢喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}